step Sorrow Hill: kill these as you meet them
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls roam the fields north of the camp; all the Scourge here drop Scourgestones.
  tip Careful: These undead notice you from far away, and other undead nearby join the fight when one is pulled.
  tip Careful: The Eye of Naxxramas (3 spawns, 15 min respawn) turns invisible when out of combat and calls in Rockwing Gargoyles once a fight starts.
  kill 1783 quest 5092.1              -- Skeletal Flayer
  kill 1791 quest 5092.2              -- Slavering Ghoul

